{"id":12382,"date":"2025-01-07T09:49:16","date_gmt":"2025-01-07T09:49:16","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=12382"},"modified":"2025-01-07T09:53:04","modified_gmt":"2025-01-07T09:53:04","slug":"analyza-nanoplastu-pomoci-ftir-snom-technologie-s-rozlisenim-10-nanometru","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/analyza-nanoplastu-pomoci-ftir-snom-technologie-s-rozlisenim-10-nanometru\/","title":{"rendered":"Anal\u00fdza nanoplast\u016f pomoc\u00ed FTIR-SNOM technologie s rozli\u0161en\u00edm 10 nanometr\u016f"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Rozhodnut\u00ed komise v p\u0159enesen\u00e9 pravomoci ze dne 11. 3. 2024 dopl\u0148uje sm\u011brnici Evropsk\u00e9ho parlamentu a Rady (EU) 2020\/2184 a stanovuje metodiku pro m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed mikroplast\u016f ve vod\u011b ur\u010den\u00e9 k lidsk\u00e9 spot\u0159eb\u011b. Toto rozhodnut\u00ed jasn\u011b definuje postupy pro odb\u011br vzork\u016f pitn\u00e9 vody a analytick\u00e9 metody, mezi kter\u00e9 pat\u0159\u00ed molekulov\u00e1 (Ramanova a FTIR) mikroskopie.<\/p>\n<p>Mikroplasty jsou mal\u00e9 \u010d\u00e1stice nebo vl\u00e1kna polymern\u00edch materi\u00e1l\u016f, jako je polystyren, polypropylen, polyamid nebo polyethylentereftal\u00e1t, o velikosti men\u0161\u00ed ne\u017e 5 mm. Normativn\u00ed analytick\u00fd postup pro pitnou vodu stanovuje jako doln\u00ed hranici detekce mikroplast\u016f velikost 20 mikrometr\u016f. Tato hodnota odpov\u00edd\u00e1 p\u0159ibli\u017en\u00e9mu difrak\u010dn\u00edmu limitu modern\u00edch infra\u010derven\u00fdch mikroskop\u016f (FTIR), kter\u00fd je d\u00e1n fyzik\u00e1ln\u00edmi vlastnostmi infra\u010derven\u00e9ho z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed.<\/p>\n<p>Z hlediska ochrany zdrav\u00ed je v\u0161ak tato hranice nedosta\u010duj\u00edc\u00ed. Men\u0161\u00ed \u010d\u00e1stice, tzv. sub-mikronov\u00e9 a nano\u010d\u00e1stice (nanoplasty), mohou b\u00fdt mnohem nebezpe\u010dn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed ne\u017e v\u011bt\u0161\u00ed objekty, proto\u017ee jejich schopnost pronikat do lidsk\u00e9ho organismu je p\u0159\u00edmo ovlivn\u011bna jejich velikost\u00ed a tvarem. Jeden z posledn\u00edch v\u011bdeck\u00fdch v\u00fdzkum\u016f nap\u0159\u00edklad uk\u00e1zal, \u017ee z \u010dajov\u00fdch s\u00e1\u010dk\u016f vyroben\u00fdch z polypropylenu, nylonu 6 nebo celul\u00f3zy se uvol\u0148uj\u00ed miliardy \u010d\u00e1stic o velikosti 140\u2013250 nanometr\u016f, co\u017e je pod rozli\u0161ovac\u00ed schopnost\u00ed b\u011b\u017en\u00fdch analytick\u00fdch technik.<\/p>\n<p>Pro sledov\u00e1n\u00ed mikroplast\u016f v pitn\u00e9 vod\u011b se standardn\u011b vyu\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 FTIR nebo Ramanova mikroskopie. Vzorky vody se filtruj\u00ed p\u0159es speci\u00e1ln\u00ed filtry vyroben\u00e9 z r\u016fzn\u00fdch materi\u00e1l\u016f, jako je k\u0159em\u00edk, st\u0159\u00edbro, zlato nebo oxid hlinit\u00fd, kter\u00e9 maj\u00ed p\u0159esn\u011b definovan\u00e9 rozm\u011bry a tvary p\u00f3r\u016f. Mikroplasty zachycen\u00e9 na filtrech jsou n\u00e1sledn\u011b automaticky detekov\u00e1ny, identifikov\u00e1ny, kvantifikov\u00e1ny a reportov\u00e1ny pomoc\u00ed softwarov\u00fdch algoritm\u016f. Pro tento typ automatick\u00e9 anal\u00fdzy je ide\u00e1ln\u00ed nap\u0159\u00edklad <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/ft-ir-mikroskop-raptir-2\/\">nov\u00fd FTIR mikroskop <strong>Nicolet RaptIR+<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>Pokud je v\u0161ak pot\u0159eba analyzovat sub-mikronov\u00e9 \u010d\u00e1stice, je nutn\u00e9 nahradit klasickou FTIR mikroskopii technikou IR-SNOM. Tato metoda, kter\u00e1 kombinuje infra\u010dervenou spektroskopii s mikroskopi\u00ed atom\u00e1rn\u00edch sil (AFM), umo\u017e\u0148uje m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed IR\/FTIR spekter v bl\u00edzk\u00e9m poli. Pro identifikaci \u010d\u00e1stic men\u0161\u00edch ne\u017e 0,5 mikrometru nab\u00edz\u00edme \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed v podob\u011b <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/ir-neascopes\/\">(FT)-IR SNOM technologie spole\u010dnosti <strong>Attocube<\/strong><\/a>. U t\u00e9to technologie je prostorov\u00e9 rozli\u0161en\u00ed detekce z\u00e1visl\u00e9 na velikosti hrotu AFM a dosahuje a\u017e 10 nanometr\u016f.<\/p>\n<p>Nov\u011b jsou pro anal\u00fdzu nanoplast\u016f k dispozici speci\u00e1ln\u00ed k\u0159em\u00edkov\u00e9 filtry. Tyto filtry, vytvo\u0159en\u00e9 pomoc\u00ed pokro\u010dil\u00fdch litografick\u00fdch a leptac\u00edch technik, maj\u00ed hexagon\u00e1ln\u011b uspo\u0159\u00e1dan\u00e9 p\u00f3ry o velikosti 250 nm a 1 \u00b5m, co\u017e umo\u017e\u0148uje postupnou filtraci vody (nap\u0159\u00edklad mo\u0159sk\u00e9). Jejich inovativn\u00ed design zaji\u0161\u0165uje vysokou stabilitu a kompatibilitu s pokro\u010dil\u00fdmi analytick\u00fdmi metodami, jako je nano-FTIR pro anal\u00fdzu nano\u010d\u00e1stic a Ramanova spektroskopie pro v\u011bt\u0161\u00ed \u010d\u00e1stice.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_12386\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-12386\" style=\"width: 450px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-12386\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/01\/a74bca5e-300x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"450\" height=\"450\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/01\/a74bca5e-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/01\/a74bca5e-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/01\/a74bca5e-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/01\/a74bca5e.png 849w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-12386\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Ramanova a FTIR spektra mikroplast\u016f a nanoplast\u016f<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Pou\u017eit\u00e1 literatura:<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rozhodnut\u00ed Komise v\u00a0p\u0159enesen\u00e9 pravomoci (EU) 2024\/1441 ze dne 11.\u00a0b\u0159ezna 2024, kter\u00fdm se dopl\u0148uje sm\u011brnice Evropsk\u00e9ho parlamentu a\u00a0Rady (EU)\u00a02020\/2184 stanoven\u00edm metodiky pro m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed mikroplast\u016f ve vod\u011b ur\u010den\u00e9 k\u00a0lidsk\u00e9 spot\u0159eb\u011b (ozn\u00e1meno pod \u010d\u00edslem C(2024)1459)<\/li>\n<li>Teabag-derived micro\/nanoplastics (true-to-life MNPLs) as a surrogate for real-life exposure scenarios, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.sciencedirect.com\/journal\/chemosphere\">Chemosphere<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.sciencedirect.com\/journal\/chemosphere\/vol\/368\/suppl\/C\">Volume 368<\/a>,\u00a0November 2024, 143736<\/li>\n<li>Multi-feature round silicon membrane filters enable fractionation and analysis of small micro- and nanoplastics with Raman spectroscopy and nano-FTIR, Anal. Methods, 2023,15, 606-617<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Rozhodnut\u00ed komise v p\u0159enesen\u00e9 pravomoci ze dne 11. 3. 2024 dopl\u0148uje sm\u011brnici Evropsk\u00e9ho parlamentu a Rady (EU) 2020\/2184 a stanovuje metodiku pro m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed mikroplast\u016f ve vod\u011b ur\u010den\u00e9 k lidsk\u00e9 spot\u0159eb\u011b. Toto rozhodnut\u00ed jasn\u011b definuje postupy pro odb\u011br vzork\u016f pitn\u00e9 vody a analytick\u00e9 metody, mezi kter\u00e9 pat\u0159\u00ed molekulov\u00e1 (Ramanova a FTIR) mikroskopie. Mikroplasty jsou mal\u00e9 \u010d\u00e1stice [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":12391,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[133,9],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-12382","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-133","category-novinky"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v26.8 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Anal\u00fdza nanoplast\u016f pomoc\u00ed FTIR-SNOM technologie s rozli\u0161en\u00edm 10 nanometr\u016f - Nicolet CZ<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-